Description: open firmware for the Apple Video Decoder (AVD)
 Open replacement firmware for the Cortex-M3 controller of the Apple Video
 Decoder in Apple Silicon Macs, generations v2 through v5, including the
 MacBook Neo transport. The kernel's AVD driver loads it from
 /usr/lib/firmware/apple; libva-v4l2-request then decodes video through it.
 .
 It is built from source; no proprietary firmware is extracted or shipped.
 The linked ELF images are kept in /usr/lib/debug/firmware/apple.
